---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Terms of Service & Editorial Disclaimers | Is It Special?"
  description="Terms of service, review independence policy, and affiliate disclaimer for Is It Special."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-20">
    <header class="space-y-3 pb-8 border-b border-stone-200">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-800">Legal Agreement</span>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-stone-900 tracking-tight">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-stone-600">
        Effective date: October 2026
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-stone prose-base sm:prose-lg max-w-none pt-8
      prose-headings:font-serif prose-headings:font-bold prose-headings:text-stone-900
      prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-p:text-stone-700">
      
      <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing and reading content on <strong>isitspecial.com</strong>, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and all applicable laws and regulations. If you disagree with any part of these terms, you are prohibited from using or accessing this site.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Editorial Independence & Disclaimers</h2>
      <p id="disclaimer">
        The articles, critiques, scoring index, and reviews published on isitspecial.com represent the subjective editorial opinions, tests, and qualitative research of our writers and editors. They are intended for informational, cultural, and educational purposes only.
      </p>
      <p>
        While we strive for extreme rigor, products can change specifications, batches, or formulations over time. Readers should independently verify pricing, warranty details, and technical compatibility directly with the manufacturer before making financial transactions.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Affiliate Disclosure (FTC & Amazon Associates Compliance)</h2>
      <p>
        To support our server hosting, independent testing, and editorial research without charging readers a subscription fee, isitspecial.com participates in affiliate marketing programs, including the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program. <strong>As an Amazon Associate, isitspecial.com earns from qualifying purchases.</strong>
      </p>
      <p>
        If you click on certain product links and make a purchase, we may receive a small referral commission at absolutely zero additional cost to you. 
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Our guarantee:</strong> Affiliate partnerships never dictate our "Special Index" scores. We routinely award low scores to high-commission products when they fail our quality standards.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        All original text, formatting, custom scoring criteria, and proprietary "Special Index" frameworks are the intellectual property of isitspecial.com. You may quote brief excerpts provided that clear attribution and a direct clickable link to the original article are included.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Contact Information</h2>
      <p>
        For inquiries regarding our terms or rights permissions, please email <a href="mailto:editorial@isitspecial.com">editorial@isitspecial.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
